{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24792","headline":"一字至七字诗 竹 · 韦式","name":"一字至七字诗 竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹，临池，似玉。\n裛露静，和烟绿。\n抱节宁改，贞心自束。\n渭曲偏种多，王家看不足。\n仙杖正惊龙化，美实当随凤熟。\n唯愁吹作别离声，回首驾骖舞阵速。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}